@@ -0,0 +1,150 @@
+
+//----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Anti-Grain Geometry - Version 2.3
+// Copyright (C) 2002-2005 Maxim Shemanarev (http://www.antigrain.com)
+//
+// Permission to copy, use, modify, sell and distribute this software
