+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Description>                                                         */
+  /*    Create a new cache to store small glyph bitmaps.                   */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Input>                                                               */
+  /*    manager :: A handle to the source cache manager.                   */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Output>                                                              */
+  /*    acache  :: A handle to the new sbit cache.  NULL in case of error. */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Return>                                                              */
+  /*    FreeType error code.  0~means success.                             */
+  /*                                                                       */
